  "name": "Greek Pasta Salad with Roasted Vegetables and Feta",
  "subtitle": "A colorful pasta salad with tender roasted vegetables and a tangy feta dressing.",
  "description": "Roasted peppers, eggplant, and squash join farfalle, greens, herbs, sun-dried tomatoes, and feta for a hearty Greek-style salad served chilled.",
